These extra required drones sum to 6+2+1+6+4+6+1+3+1+1 = 31. (Fields with lower threat such as Field_1, Field_2, Field_3, Field_5, Field_6, Field_8, Field_13, Field_16, Field_19 are not chosen.) 

Step 3 – For each chosen field, we “lock in” the drones already protecting it:
